pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# Wall-time title-screen capture for profiling the animated title without
# advancing into the profile/menu flow. Run with --include-opening-movies: the
# movie-complete transition creates the real animated background, while the
# skip hook leaves a cheap flat-green screen and is not a valid performance
# reproduction.
# clock-hz 60
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 120 2000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 132 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 300 2000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 312 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 2000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 492 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 660 2000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 672 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 900 opening-15s
capture 1800 opening-30s
capture 3600 title-60s
stop 3900
